help
Available commands:
  help - show this help
  version - build id, git revision, board, configuration
  status - run state and counters
  regs - clock, ADC, DMA and UART registers
  start - start the burst stream
  stop - stop after the current buffer
  samc <0..31> - sample time in TAD steps
  input <0..15> - analog input (PINSEL)
  selftest - sample the internal reference
  stats - min/max/mean of the completed half
  dump [count] [offset] - samples of the buffer (snap first)
  clear - zero the error counters
  led on|off|auto - LED0
  sweep [halves] - overrun vs sample rate over the clock ladder
  clk <100..1000> - CLKGEN6 divide ratio x 100 (does NOT change the rate)
  pll <p1> <p2> - PLL1 output dividers = the sample rate
  test [all|self|clock|clkoff|bursts|matrix|rate|sweep|dac] [n]
  core <1..5> [pinsel] - switch the ADC core
  buf [n] - samples per buffer half (16..1024, even)
  dac <1|2> <on|off> [low] [high] [slpdat] - triangle on DACOUT1/2
  dactest [halves] - judge the running DAC's triangle through the chain
  snap - fill the buffer once and stop; then dump it
  rate <ksps> - the sample rate, 4000..40000
  blk [n] - the sample block as binary, with a CRC
  chain all|<n>|from <n>|run <ksps> [s] - the chain test
  stream on <ksps> [core pinsel [samc]]|off|grab - the chain streaming, main() processing, one halt/transfer/restart cycle
  reset - software reset
